>>
endobj
352 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 121 0 R
/E (possible pair of points. The method is simple, transparent, and useful as a correctness reference because no pair is skipped. Its disadvantage is its quadratic number of pair evaluations, which becomes the dominant cost at large input sizes. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
353 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 121 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 15 0 R
